{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1270","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1270/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1270/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1270/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1270","id":3265153950,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7Cnkue","number":1270,"title":"Request to Add Groq API Support to Custom Models in Trae IDE","user":{"login":"AlexMattyou","id":98243103,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdsSHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98243103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexMattyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-26T05:36:59Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T02:06:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi Trae Team,\n\nI recently started using Trae IDE, and I really like its clean interface and smooth performance. 🙌\n\nIn the Custom Models section, I noticed support for services like OpenRouter and Gemini, but I couldn’t find an option for the Groq API.\n\nGroq is currently one of the fastest and most cost-effective AI providers available. It supports many popular open-source models, including LLaMA 3, Mixtral, DeepSeek, Qwen, and Gemma. I frequently use Groq in Void IDE, and the experience has been excellent — especially the speed, which feels extremely responsive for development work.\n\nHere’s their playground: 👉 https://console.groq.com/playground\n\nI believe adding Groq support in Trae would make it much easier for users like me to access these models directly inside the IDE. So I’d like to suggest adding Groq API integration to the Custom Models feature.\n\nThank you for reading and for continuously improving Trae! 🙏\n","closed_by":{"login":"AlexMattyou","id":98243103,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdsSHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98243103?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexMattyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMattyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/rep